Upstream-Name: rnode-nomu
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/arader/rnode-nomu/issues
Source: https://github.com/arader/rnode-nomu
Comment: NOTICE.md, installed next to this file, lists which parts translate RNode_Firmware
 v1.86 (https://github.com/markqvist/RNode_Firmware, commit 56775c5). THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md
 lists the Rust crates compiled into /usr/bin/rnode-nomu, with their licenses.

Files: *
Copyright: 2026 rnode-nomu contributors
License: GPL-3+

Files: crates/rnode-core/*
Copyright: 2026 rnode-nomu contributors
           2024 Mark Qvist
Comment: Translates the host protocol, TX queue, split framing, CSMA/CA, airtime, PHY timing,
 EEPROM image, power amplifier tables and main loop of RNode_Firmware.
License: GPL-3+

Files: crates/rnode-sx126x/*
Copyright: 2026 rnode-nomu contributors
           Sandeep Mistry, Mark Qvist and Jacob Eva
Comment: Translates RNode_Firmware's SX126x modem driver, sx126x.cpp, which is under the MIT
 (Expat) license, and is distributed as part of rnode-nomu under GPL-3+.
License: GPL-3+ and Expat

